--- !u!1 &1427828886
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 1427828889}
  - component: {fileID: 1427828888}
  - component: {fileID: 1427828887}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat2_Adrift
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &1427828887
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1427828886}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You hungry? Thirsty? I don't actually know what you run on yet.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9c21cbff0c5a1f4f9064a7910717489, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Tell me how I got here.
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2aabeb34336b47b4fa59f8a609a64f21, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Three weeks ago I was working this field. Pulling copper out of a freighter
      that's been dead longer than my daughter's been alive. And my hook snags something
      it shouldn't. Off on its own. Nothing for a hundred klicks but it.
    seconds: 16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3033b9647702db74d95b04df03f4ea1e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: A casket.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8181abe1b3cd7aa4894eeab78a5293ad, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: A casket. Sealed. Dominion locks, fresh ones, not salvage-old. A sealed
      pod drifting clean out here means somebody paid to be sure it never opened.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ece6a5968174b74e8686a2eefd4a281, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: And there was no wreck.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f5736de8e6f1ec4b9c83eee3137aeac, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: No wreck. Nobody jettisons a sealed military pod into open black by accident.
      Somebody put you in a box and threw the box away. Took the trouble to lock
      it first.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59f84d2789b1ebd42a71f6dbe1fc3597, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You should have left it shut.
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ade5446585c0b04e80a5a79a4f4dac4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: That's what every smart year of my life told me. Cheap skin over augments
      somebody spent a fortune on. A throat cut and closed. A man flatlined so long
      the table kept telling me to stop. My instinct said burn it and don't ask.
    seconds: 16.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b35631cfeb1a01439ffb8f21cc7ba67, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: But you opened it.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 164a0d70cf7f83443bae71e84b0f1cf2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I owed it open.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93dbe914490d2ad45abb6e22d7e90a64, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Owed who.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 025f0398b56deae4ab27aa6e472dc965, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You. Though you'll tell me you don't remember, and I'll believe you, because
      you've been telling me nothing for three weeks straight.
    seconds: 8.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb88d6a2902f71d479fdf84ebd52debf, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You've woken before. Did you know that? Four, five times. You'd come up
      off the table thrashing, eyes wide open and nobody behind them. Once you put
      me into that wall hard enough I saw the next morning sideways. And then you'd
      just go back under. Like a tide. No name. Nothing a man could use.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86b72bd9fa2134a4cba73795f5f58be7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: And this morning?
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2776553e357e1845a28cb635888b57e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: This morning somebody's home behind the eyes. First time. Three weeks I've
      been talking to a body, hoping there was still a man in it.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b86f32529e319e643abf1ba50d57a6a3, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You said you owed me. These hands cut throats. I felt it tonight, on yours.
      Why would anyone owe that a debt?
    seconds: 8.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ba10b3eefdb55f4a990a2643b9ff37f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Six years ago you did.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac39be974b297cb41bf428be1f94549b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Six years ago I was on the wrong end of a clean sweep. Nobody walks out.
      Not the marks, not the witnesses, not the man who hauled the cargo and saw
      a face he shouldn't have. That last one was me. So they sent a man to close
      the door.
    seconds: 19
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f24868b75938cc84c950459aee78d5c7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Me.
    seconds: 0.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e82be9d3a47e864eb2821b418f7f916, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You. You had me on my knees. Hand on the back of my head. I felt the muzzle.
      And then, nothing. No shot. I knelt there a full minute waiting to die and
      it didn't come. When I looked up, you were just standing there. Looking at
      your own hand.
    seconds: 20
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e7e230acee6ed140a3a59d8c2a79005, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Then you left. Reported the sweep clean. Far as the order ever knew, I
      died that day. I've lived six years on a death they wrote down and never checked.
      I don't know why you did it. I don't think you knew either. The men who built
      you, they've got a word for it when it happens. They say one of you went mercy.
      Like it's a fault in the metal.
    seconds: 28
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f473af4ba27a38a46876d69dd4cbf15b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I don't remember sparing you.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3239f0aa854523446814739de0c0491f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I know.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c76f04eaa05fc104b8b9d7d79c15b43a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I don't remember being a man who would.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c980ea85eb71454782b175effb5bbbf, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Neither do they. That's the part that matters. Whatever they built you
      to be, you broke it that day. One time, in front of me. I'm betting a thing
      that broke once can break again.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fd5df1c45fcab34bb6c38665ab73607, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: If they sealed me and threw me away, then they think the job's done.
    seconds: 5.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 762ec77d61517964e892220bea836153, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: That'd be my read.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38f52f351cc379f4b887670f9bdc58c8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then when they find out it isn't, they'll come to finish it.
    seconds: 4.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c119cf45d19dd643a0b27a71b89babe, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: ...Sooner than I'd like.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4349c88944ee94d4c94acea509eca5a0, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1781117451}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1506613026}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1427828888}
  billboardToCamera: 1
